# Hacky Hours team repo .gitignore

# Local-only overrides (sensitive customizations)
*.local
**/.hacky-hours-*.local

# Build outputs from the static site
docs/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Note: agents/*/history.md, feedback.md, and preferences.yml ARE committed.
# That's how the team's memory survives across sessions and devices.
